# ==========================================
# ACCESO DIRECTO AL MICROSERVICIO (Sin Gateway)
# ==========================================

### 1. Listar todos los clientes (sin token - debería dar 401)
GET {{gateway}}/api/clientes

### 2. Listar todos los clientes (con token)
GET {{msClientes}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Obtener un cliente por ID (ID: 1)
GET {{msClientes}}/api/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Obtener un cliente por ID (ID inexistente - debería dar 404)
GET {{msClientes}}/api/clientes/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ==========================================
# A TRAVÉS DEL GATEWAY (Punto de entrada único)
# ==========================================

### 5. Listar todos los clientes (vía Gateway)
GET {{gateway}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Obtener un cliente por ID (vía Gateway)
GET {{gateway}}/api/clientes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Crear un nuevo cliente
POST http://localhost:41071/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "cliente1", "password": "1234" }

### Actualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:41071/api/clientes/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellido": "Garcia Editado",
  "dni": "44444444",
  "latitud": -31.420,
  "longitud": -64.188
}

### Toggle disponibilidad de técnico
PATCH http://localhost:41071/api/tecnicos/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/disponibilidad?disponible=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar certificaciones
GET http://localhost:41071/api/tecnicos/certificaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver candidatos de una solicitud
GET http://localhost:41071/api/solicitudes/1/candidatos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reprogramar
POST http://localhost:41071/api/solicitudes/1/reprogramar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nuevaFecha": "2026-12-01T15:00:00",
  "motivo": "El cliente no estaba"
}

### Login programático
POST http://localhost:41071/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "cliente1",
  "password": "1234"
}

